OL,3,AThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,8,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,9,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,11,FEngland
