OL,3,AFirst personalised cancer vaccine cuts
OL,4,Arisk of disease returning in major
OL,5,Atrial
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new personalised cancer vaccine given
OL,8,Falongside a widely used immunotherapy
OL,9,Fdrug has cut the risk of patients dying
OL,10,For their skin cancer returning by 42%
OL,11,Fin a major clinical trial.
OL,13,FThe researchers involved say the
OL,14,Fresults could mark a turning point in
OL,15,Fcancer treatment, bringing personalised
OL,16,Fmedicine a step closer.
OL,18,FThe trial also found that the new drug
OL,19,Fcombination reduced the risk of
OL,20,Fmelanoma, a type of skin cancer,
OL,21,Fspreading by 38% over two years
OL,22,Fcompared to immunotherapy alone.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
