OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled across
OL,4,AEast Asia as Typhoon Champi roars
OL,5,Atoward Taiwan
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least one person has died in Taiwan
OL,8,Fafter being swept away by waves,
OL,9,Faccording to authorities
OL,11,FChampi is the latest in a string of
OL,12,Fintense typhoons as a Super El Nino
OL,13,Fheats up the Pacific Ocean and fuels
OL,14,Fstorms
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
